# Preface {.unnumbered}

This is a notebook for my journey into generative AI that I generated during my break from work during the fall & winter of 2025

1.  **ChatGTP basics** by OpenAI Acadamy online tutorials (free) <https://academy.openai.com/>
2.  **Prompt engineering** courses by Jules White on Coursera (subscription 42E/month) <https://www.coursera.org/>
3.  **Data analysis with ChatGTP** by Jules White on Coursera
4.  **Building trustworthy AI** by Jules White on Coursera
5.  **History of generative AI** self-learning with ChatGTP +Perplexity
6.  **Ethics and risks** self-learning
